---
title: 'Exploring the LLM evaluation frontier: how we produce it'
---

Stencila Cloud's model router provides you with the "best" model for your input.
This document describes how that's achieved.

It does this by analyzing the outputs of various benchmarking services to
produce normalized scores for quality, speed and cost.

## Speed

This section describes how the speed scores are distributed across models.

## Starting point

The repository that performs this analysis is available on GitHub at [github.com/stencila/evals](https://github.com/stencila/evals).

